    "name": {
      "value": "The Tangled Briar"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "sf2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "_The Tangled Briar_ signifies the return of ancient triumphs. As long as you have _The Tangled Briar_ invested, you gain Toughness as a bonus feat. If you already possess this feat, increase your maximum Hit Points by twice your level.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per day\nYou raise the card up above your head and invoke the thorns and briars of the tangled parts of the world; you cast wall of thorns. The level of the spell is half your level, rounded down (minimum 6th level). The brambles within this particular wall of thorns are treated as greater difficult terrain."
    },
